<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Biper launches IPO.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Biper launches IPO.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican beeper services company Biper SA launched an initial public offering on Wednesday worth 205.15 million pesos, the company said.</p>
<p>The company will issue 74.6 million series B ordinary shares at a price of 2.75 pesos, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Once the issue is placed, the shares will represent 15.01 percent of the company's total share capital.</p>
<p>The offer will last Wednesday and Thursday.</p>
<p>BBV-Probursa brokerage is acting as lead manager of the deal.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau +528 345 7617))</p>
